Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》  作者卡文·爱德路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernatural by Carver Edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有的事都写在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is in here, I mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆种族歧视的卡车  我上床的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the racist truck to me having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-月门  -等等  那不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moondoor. - Wait, is that --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维护月女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defend the queen of moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我爱你  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二道测试是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the second trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地狱拯救一个无辜的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}An innocent soul has to be rescued from hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并将它送入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and delivered unto heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文·谭  以为你能躲我一辈子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran. Thought you could elude me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小毛孩逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little geek made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(杜鲁门否认军事试验一事)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1951年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"1951"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(24小时前)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我给你动五分钟的剪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me five minutes with some clippers, and --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候睡下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what time did I lay down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中午的时候睡下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a siesta around noon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天中午\N{\fnArial\fs30}yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我们没什么贵重东西  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we don't have nice things, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm -- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就...这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去穿衣服  我们得去找凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get dressed. We should go find Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悠着点  睡美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy, sleeping beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经黑进了盖思船屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hacked into every security camera
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文家乡  和谭太太住所周围的\N{\fnArial\fs30}around Garth's houseboat, Kevin's hometown,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}where mrs. Tran lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前还没有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思出去找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Garth is out looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也向其他猎人通告了凯文的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a hunter A.P.B. out on Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在这儿尽力找他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will do what we can from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着你养好身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我能出去活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can still go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能去猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit that target,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再谈让你出去行动的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll talk about you getting back out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二个测试对你的伤害比第一个要大很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, that second trial hit you a lot harder than that first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是因为第二个更难还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether it was just more intense or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但第二天就觉出不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要按兵不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're gonna sit tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:05:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿盯着  等你有所好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep an eye out until you, uh, get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(你有新邮件)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在附近  给你们找了个活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the neighborhood, found you guys a case."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找了个活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found us a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the neighborhood"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么知道我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell's she know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...well, she doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少不知道准确位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说她追踪我们的手机到20英里的范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says she tracked our cells to a 20-mile radius, 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后信号就丢失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the signal went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方肯定像是百幕大三角那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place must be in some kind of, like, Bermuda triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以在这儿接听和拨打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can make and receive phone calls from here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不被人查到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nobody can track us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真爱这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挺好的  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I'm -- I'm good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来堪萨斯干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in Kansas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托皮卡在举办漫展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, a comic convention, in Topeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可是工作日啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle of the week?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收藏总是得去买啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's got to get her collectibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要请我去你们的地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you gonna invite me into your dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是得先受一番审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do I got to answer your questions three first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你介绍记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us introduce you to the men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太帅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜他们灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad they got wiped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是名字起的那么性感  必然要红颜薄命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}though that is what they get for the sexist name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  这就是我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway, that's our skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟亡灵战士做了个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a deal with the yesteryear weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要组团去灭了影兽人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna team up to stomp the shadow orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还来参加年中的聚会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are still coming to the midyear jubilee, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的活儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about this case you brought us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在托皮卡的时候  发现了这条消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was in Topeka, I saw this pop up over the wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨莱纳的一个收银员  汤姆·布雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Blake, a checkout clerk in Salina
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在回家的路上失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}who went missing on his way home from work --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天发现了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was found dead yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}His insides?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被液化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liquefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当地警方完全摸不着头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals have no idea what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们试图把案子掩盖起来  以免引起恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to bury the report so people wouldn't freak,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但被我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I flagged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经排除了以下这些夜行的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have eliminated the following things that go bump in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候变成专家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you become such an expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们走之后  我开始钻研各种鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after you guys left, I dug into all things monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点点入迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a wee bit obsessive...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说一点点不如说是完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}If "a wee bit" means completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还找到了卡文·爱德路德写的系列丛书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also found this series of books by Carver Edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些书都是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did those books really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可真是疯狂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some meta-madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢二位拯救世界什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for saving the world and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉你一直得不到性福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry you have zero luck with the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把那些书全部找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find every single copy of those books
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经发在网上了  估计是烈火烧不尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're online now, so good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩疯孩子去处理那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you two crazy kids deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看你找的这个活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go see if there's anything to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:55.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是真有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, case of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没事  -有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没恢复之前不能出去行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking a knee as long as you're off your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no disrespect, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是读猎魔故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there is a big difference
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟真正出去猎魔的差别是很大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}between reading about hunting and actually hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能击中靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you can hit that target,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we can talk about you --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, if you're gonna do a ride-along, then, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把那过家家的衣服换掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to lose the novelty T-shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a pantsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Montage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试  肯定不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trials? That's never good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  而且我们的先知还跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and our prophet's in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about, uh, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎挺有帮助  挺迷糊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems helpful and dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's M.I.A.,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也带着一块石碑  鬼知道他要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a tablet of his own doing god knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  整件事都...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, to be honest, this whole thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是个坚强的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Sam's a tough son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是小卡说这些测试对他的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Cass was saying that these trials are messing with him 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连他都无法治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}in ways that even he can't heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能给你点安慰  读了你们的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's any consolation, having read your history --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得温家兄弟合璧\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is pretty much nothing the Winchesters can't do 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所不敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉很好吧  有个弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be nice, having a brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远有人照应着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone to always watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有兄弟姐妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No brothers or sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I have two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫XBOX和PS3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their names are xbox and ps3.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收不到信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting any reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借你手机用用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I use your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂  -是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Hey. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  迪恩  我依然没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dean, I'm still fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能去猎魔的  -那就继续养着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I can hunt. - Well, let the healing continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check in with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我是特别探员希克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh, special agent Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我搭档  特别探员雷普利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, special agent Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是为内脏融化的那个尸体而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here about the body with the creamy filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你们会对此有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you guys would have any interest in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是联调局啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不放过任何谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never leave a stone unturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if we take a peek?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要看一下签好的监管申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need your signed chain-of-custody request,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上级写给我的监管申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain-of-custody request from your supervisor to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我上级打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to call my supervisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会同意让你移交尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he can give you the override or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我拿不到申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he can get me the form,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能把尸体交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give you access to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我们是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道  但是文件还是不能省\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, dear, but paperwork is paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗  是詹妮弗是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer. Uh, it is Jennifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都开车一整天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we have been on the road all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是正规程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is strictly routine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该查的东西都得查什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dot-the-"I," Cross-the-"T" kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你帮个忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could do us a solid...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着申请表回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back with the signed form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会很乐意帮你忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to do you a solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书上可没写过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That never happened in the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要说说刚刚怎么变成熊包了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me happened back there, Boo-radley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我傻掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I-I froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不能退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't control-alt-delete my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实生活中的角色扮演好难啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real-life role-playing is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们待会儿再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll come back later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等那个死板的女人下班了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when, uh, Doris do right isn't here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  还要擅闯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perfect. Breaking and entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟做黑客有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No different than hacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个我从少年时代就开始做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I've been doing since I was a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个我只做过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other I've done once
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们两个白痴在场外指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you two idiots walking me through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还弄断了我的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I had my arm broken in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少年时代黑什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you hack when you were a teenager?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北美防空联合司令部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...NORAD.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你吧  游戏狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Whatever you say, "WarGames."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正得在这儿等着  去吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go grab some grub while we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我拿到了三颗星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. I got three stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比你高了三个级别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm three levels ahead of you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊  我太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别啊  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. No, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸才叫不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这次你该先说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should go first this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续干活儿了  孩子  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back on the horse, kiddo. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别探员雷普利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am special agent Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们另一个探员在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your other agent's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么才到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you guys so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查案啊  跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working the case. Same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾克·希尔  图书管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Hill. Librarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天失踪  与另一个被害人无关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went missing yesterday, no relation to the other vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,验尸官已经把他的遗骸收拾走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner already swooped in and scooped up what was left of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们见过她了  挺死板的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, we met her. Bit of a stickler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有尸体  没什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's, uh, not a body, nothing else to see here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you head on home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没跟目击者谈过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still haven't talked to the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理  你去跟目击者谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, why don't you go talk to the witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想错过兄弟基情的戏码\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want to miss the "Bro-ment."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得很沮丧  但你病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I know you're frustrated, but you're also sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会走的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别探员雷普利  我是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Ripley, FBI and...stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在玩什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What game you guys playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吞噬者\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Super eater."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"地下冒险"还是"异度穿越"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Underworld adventures" or "Dimension travelers"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"地下冒险"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Underworld adventures."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚刚经历的那个童年精神创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, about that childhood trauma you experienced earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想帮忙  我理解  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to help. I do, all right?But -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你不能照顾我们两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you cannot take care of the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得出来活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫忍痛坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Play through the pain" right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  别拿我的话揶揄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Don't quote me to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个孩子说他们注意到胳膊上有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the boys said they noticed something on the body's arm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就被溅了一身  日后要做不少治疗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it covered them in years of future therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说看上去像个蓝色的手印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said it looked like a blue handprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来是你该读过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like something you should read about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在家里的某本书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a book. At home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们找到这杀人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we find out whatever's doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们吵架像对老夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys fight like an old married couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话我们就不用闯入验尸官的办公室了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean we don't have to break into the coroner's office anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:15:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷了你的车  我知道他要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole your car. I think I know where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你偷了我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you stole my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.33,0:16:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么才到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去加油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped for gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  尸体在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. The body's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是验尸官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the coroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前门开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Front door was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, w-what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, came back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要一份空白的你说的那个申请表\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a blank copy of that form you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局没有监管申请表吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI doesn't have chain-of-custody forms?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外勤局电力出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The field office had a power outage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为发生了火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}after catching fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想不如来借一两份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured I could just borrow a copy or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Just give me sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们焚烧了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burned the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这么快  -是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Already? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们觉得是有传染病爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think it's some kind of, like, outbreak scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还找了疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even got the CDC to sign off on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人真谨慎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These folks run a tight ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:17:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那如果没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去停尸间工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some work to do in the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能问个私人问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can I ask you a personal question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是才开始穿正装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am new to the whole power-suit thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是帅呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们是得赶紧给自己消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean we need to take "Silkwood" showers now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是接着查\N{\fnArial\fs30}or is this still a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两个孩子说的印记我有点印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Something about that mark the kid saw rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概得去查传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably have to check the lore --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者爸爸的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要三套短上装  三条裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need are three jackets, three pairs of pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么简单  好聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So simple, so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该开个博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have a blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我去整一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll get right on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个  还有鞋子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so, what about shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是找不到合适的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never find the right kind to go with --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  抱歉  我可不是造型师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm sorry, but I'm not a stylist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你的表格和着装建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the forms and the fashion advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持自我哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}'kay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把猎物吞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They consume their prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能死者是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe the vics were leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报告说两处都未见黑色胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No black goo on either scene, according to the reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙  它们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons. They, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者身上没有焦痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signs of burns on the vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西真烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被精灵整死的内脏不会融化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn vics don't get liquefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  不是一般的精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. Not regular djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里说  有一系精灵的分支\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, there is a bastard offshoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛闪蓝光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, their eyes light up blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来跟普通人一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pass as humans, all that regular jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过会"让猎物的内脏变成果冻"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except these "Leave their victims with jelly-like insides",
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据称  他们给猎物下毒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and supposedly, when they poison their victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会留下蓝色的掌印\N{\fnArial\fs30}they leave behind a blue handprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西真烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:20:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那能用杀普通精灵的办法杀他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do these things die like regular Djinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蘸了羔羊血的银刀  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver blade dipped in lamb's blood, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在找到那个混蛋就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just got to find the asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有了突破  我该吃点东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, breakthrough means snack time to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还想活动活动筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to just, uh, stretch my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会带点吃的回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will pick us up some grub,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我不会像你一样  忘了馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and unlike you, Sam, I will not forget the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.77,0:20:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉不觉得她有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seem a little off to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一来就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the second she got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是那事  回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...again, call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理回话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word from Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托皮卡可没举办什么漫展\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was no comic convention in Topeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道她是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要对我们撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why would she lie to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个办法查明原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用她的手机给你打电话时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I called you from her phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺手把她的GPS打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned on her GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.99,0:22:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.45,0:22:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理  在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个什么鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  这些都是查理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it belongs to Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是她的其他身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some variation of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是什么人  杰森·伯恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is she -- Jason Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:23:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  没发现强行闯入的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, we got no forced entry,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么是她认识的人  要么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so either it was somebody that she knew or --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.81,0:23:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手机上都是咱们的未接来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's all our missed calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在电脑上发现什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything on her laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在通过她的化名给托皮卡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she's been making donations through her aliases
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖尼郡综合医院捐款\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Shawnee County General here in Topeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, a charity?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给一个病人  叫格特鲁德·米德尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A patient. Gertrude middleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要找到答案  我去找格特鲁德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need answers. Uh, I'll take Gertrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继续找关于精灵的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep djinn-digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.31,0:23:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格特鲁德16年来一直处于植物人的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gertrude's been in a persistent vegetative state for 16 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年前情况恶化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year ago, her condition got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全靠呼吸机维持生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ventilator's the only thing keeping her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和丈夫被酒驾司机撞到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and her husband were hit by a drunk driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丈夫死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是去接在朋友家过夜的女儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were on their way to pick up their daughter from a sleepover.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她父母出事后  她惹上了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got into trouble after her parents' accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自那时起  没人知道她的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's heard from her since.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些年大伙儿一直给格特鲁德捐医疗费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks have been donating to cover Gertrude's care over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:24:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是好心  但她其实已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sweet gesture, but the truth is, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人来看望她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ever get any visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有几个护士曾说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple nurses said they thought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到有人给她读东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}they saw someone in here reading to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.73,0:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没人在前台签字探视\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody's ever officially signed in to visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一直都是孤零零的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我得去查房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, I have to make my rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.79,0:24:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.93,0:24:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米德尔顿太太  你有个好女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one hell of a daughter, Mrs. Middleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证  我会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you I will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此处有尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilhelm Scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.70,0:24:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我在你身上闻到了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I smell on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.55,0:24:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,止汗剂  可能还有尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deodorant? A little pee, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.19,0:24:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.29,0:25:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵能闻到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn smell fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.66,0:25:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们知道精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know about Djinn,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.94,0:25:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你和你的小朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you and your little friend
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不是联调局的探员  是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}are hunters, not FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是正在打怪升级的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm -- I'm more hunter-in-training.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.06,0:25:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀我多没意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally not worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀你可有意思了  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but you are worth killing, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.60,0:25:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我们这类吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, my kind --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相比一般的精灵  我们偏好苦的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We prefer a more bitter taste to blood than the run-of-the-mill Djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.37,0:25:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们喜欢恐惧的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We prefer the taste of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.95,0:25:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在停尸间闻到你的味道时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I got a whiff of you at that morgue...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上散发的恐惧太诱人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, such delicious fear inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.35,0:25:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我跟着你的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed your scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.49,0:25:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你足够我们两个吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd make a meal fit for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.64,0:25:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no chance of a recovery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.89,0:25:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:25:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会了  格特鲁德看起来是个很棒的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Gertrude seemed like a cool mom, too --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和蔼  坚强  过早跟家人分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind, strong, taken from her family way too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你想起谁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind you of anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.87,0:26:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个九年前的无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A John Doe from nine years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.73,0:26:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时的验尸官想把尸体送去疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original coroner wanted the body sent to the CDC,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.45,0:26:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但验尸官的新助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the coroner's new assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.12,0:26:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不小心"把尸体送去烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"accidentally" ordered the body to be burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-新助手  -詹妮弗·奥布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New assistant? - Jennifer O'brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,验尸官还真是个不错的掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner's a hell of a cover for hiding kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那个威猛的男性朋友会来抓你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My manly man friend's gonna come get you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.71,0:26:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个穿职业装的怪女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you creepy power-suit lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们尽管来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let him come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.39,0:26:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He reeked of fear, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.31,0:26:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个  疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. CDC?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.74,0:26:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次也没收到詹妮弗的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard from Jennifer this time, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.57,0:26:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她假造了报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}She faked the reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.53,0:26:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧毁尸体来掩盖踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}burned the bodies to cover her tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么九年后她又变粗心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she get sloppy again after nine years,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.97,0:26:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把尸体留在会被人发现的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}start leaving the bodies where they could be found?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去问问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.36,0:26:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.61,0:26:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在镇上有两处房产\N{\fnArial\fs30}she owns two pieces of property in town --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.60,0:26:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个离这儿十分钟的双卧室房\N{\fnArial\fs30}One 2-bedroom house about 10 minutes from here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.41,0:27:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个废弃船舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an abandoned shipping warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.03,0:27:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.84,0:27:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.59,0:27:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.54,0:27:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.98,0:28:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵不同  或许解药也不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, different djinn. Maybe she needs a different antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在发烧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's burning up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.69,0:28:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让她化成果冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not letting her turn to jello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.52,0:28:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵的毒液让人的大脑陷入循环的幻境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn poison puts your brain into something like a feedback loop 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.62,0:28:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时血温开始飙升  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}while your blood boils, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果解药没能打破循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, if the antidote didn't break the loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.33,0:28:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们或许应该想办法从内部打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe we can find a way to break from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵让你进入令你快乐的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, djinn take you to your happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.65,0:28:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方就像是梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your happy place is like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非洲梦根\N{\fnArial\fs30}African dream root.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.56,0:29:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.07,0:29:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我得赶快睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna need to go to sleep fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.44,0:29:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...给我一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, uh, punch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不想的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I know you don't want to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不大行了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you're a little off your game there
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.33,0:29:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太...这简直太...\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that was, uh, that was pretty --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想活命就跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.49,0:30:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always wanted to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.91,0:30:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在我梦里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.20,0:30:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被一个精灵袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were attacked by a djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个验尸官  詹妮弗  还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coroner, Jennifer, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵一般让你去令你开心的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn usually send you to your, uh, happy, your happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.89,0:30:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.68,0:30:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你的欢乐点还真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you got a really strange sense of happy, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.86,0:30:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗说他们汲取恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer said that her kind feeds off fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.54,0:30:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的开心之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我不断重复的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a recurring nightmare of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.60,0:30:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是什么  -一个电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - It's a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说这一切都是个电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me that this whole thing is a video game?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.03,0:30:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫"红色恐惧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was called "The Red Scare."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.69,0:30:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一视角枪手对阵超级吸血鬼士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, first-person shooter against super-soldier vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.19,0:30:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从一家游戏公司的服务器上拷贝了半成品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I copied it off of a game company's server before it was finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.45,0:30:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并重新编写  来表达我高涨的自由主义信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}reprogrammed it to reflect my flamingly liberal politics,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.27,0:30:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后免费发放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I released it for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.77,0:30:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们找到了我把我抓了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they tracked me down and had me arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候我12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.97,0:31:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就一直在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been on the run ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.94,0:31:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.85,0:31:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你打了精灵解药  但没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gave you the djinn antidote. It didn't take.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.13,0:31:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把那精灵杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I killed the djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.31,0:31:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去帮萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get back and help Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.91,0:31:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说这游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.22,0:31:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we can win --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.04,0:32:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我昏迷多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know how long I've been out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.74,0:32:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我已经把这关玩了一千遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've been through this level a thousand times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.95,0:32:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.56,0:32:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次我通关救下病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I beat the level and save the patients,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.25,0:32:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就重新回到起始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get reset back to the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是武器越来越少吸血鬼越来越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}only there's less weapons and the vampires are faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是无限循环的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an infinite loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.07,0:32:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像没有256关的吃豆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like pac-man without level 256.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.50,0:32:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.80,0:32:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  什么病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what patients?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.66,0:32:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.24,0:32:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失踪后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you went missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆找到了你的临时住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Sam found your little crash pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到了你给她打的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw the payments that you make for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.90,0:32:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看了你妈妈  想找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I went and visited your mom, looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.61,0:33:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是为她来到堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's why I'm in Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.57,0:33:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要可以  就会溜进医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sneak into the hospital whenever I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.66,0:33:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读书给她听\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just -- I read to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候  她晚上会给我读睡前故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to read me to sleep at night when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.98,0:33:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会读《霍比特人》给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd read me "The Hobbit."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.35,0:33:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她  我才会喜欢这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the reason I love the stuff I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.94,0:33:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为你失去亲人感到遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.25,0:33:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.17,0:33:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的噩梦还是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this my nightmare or yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.45,0:34:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.54,0:34:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞砸的不是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your mama who messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.94,0:34:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.04,0:34:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.41,0:34:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚成年  我得吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came of age. I had to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.97,0:34:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.40,0:34:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈知道如何掩盖踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-mom knew how to cover her tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.36,0:34:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总是提醒我不要和食物玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always told me not to play with my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.79,0:34:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你该听你妈的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should have listened to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.69,0:34:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是最终关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it -- the boss battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.36,0:34:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  我们得救下病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we got to save the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.59,0:34:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们陷入了循环里  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that we're stuck in a loop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.38,0:34:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在外面的真实世界里  你却快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And out there in the real world, you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.39,0:34:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I might be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.23,0:34:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得想办法打破这个循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find a way to break this loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.80,0:34:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得唯一终止这事的办法就是不玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the only way to stop this is to not play.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.10,0:34:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.20,0:35:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  我们得救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. We've got to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.37,0:35:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快想办法  温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nut up, Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.37,0:35:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  你也停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? You can't stop, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.91,0:35:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  精灵毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, this poison --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.15,0:35:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是要让你的思维进入无限循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's designed to put your mind into an endless cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.29,0:35:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你的内脏则开始融化  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}while your insides turn to mush, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.32,0:35:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的燃料就是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its fuel is fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.23,0:35:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以说我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, call me crazy, 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.11,0:35:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得打破循环的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think the only way to break this cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.84,0:35:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是不要管恐惧  不要玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to let go of the fear and stop playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.91,0:35:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.62,0:35:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是你的恐惧制造了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that your fear is creating all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.07,0:35:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但怕的不是外面那些超级吸血鬼士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not afraid of those super-soldier vamps out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.56,0:35:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕的不是这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not afraid of this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.06,0:35:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是这一切对你的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not afraid of what it did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.45,0:35:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.57,0:35:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕失去她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid of losing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.46,0:35:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理  她已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, she's already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.43,0:35:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.99,0:35:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.07,0:35:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在外面过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at a sleepover, 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.94,0:35:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕了  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got scared, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.19,0:35:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打给我爸妈让他们来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called my parents to come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.30,0:35:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们那晚本不该开车出门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should never have been driving that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.68,0:35:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.39,0:35:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想告诉她我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to tell her that I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.30,0:35:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I love her
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.98,0:36:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想让她能再听到一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just have her hear it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.93,0:36:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要她再听到一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need her to hear that one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她不能  她不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she can't. She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.51,0:36:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.65,0:36:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你得放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.05,0:36:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.48,0:37:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.80,0:37:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.05,0:37:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.02,0:37:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.83,0:37:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.79,0:37:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生了什么  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.23,0:37:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.69,0:37:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.63,0:38:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救了我俩的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks for saving our bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.05,0:38:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时待命  殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.49,0:38:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你会没事的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're gonna be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.66,0:38:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些书把你描绘得好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those books portray you as, like, 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好对付的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}one tough customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有谁能通过测试  那一定是你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone can get through the trials, Sam, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.18,0:38:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.65,0:38:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的应该回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you really should come back
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.89,0:38:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翻看我们的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dig through our archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对是个女记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are definitely a woman of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.66,0:38:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.62,0:38:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你顺便来访  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for stopping by, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.41,0:38:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直想试试进入游戏世界呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always wanted to get "Tron"ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.88,0:38:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接下来要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna go by the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.83,0:39:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得放手了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to let go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.93,0:39:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.93,0:39:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.62,0:39:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.90,0:39:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.38,0:39:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.47,0:39:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该乖乖待着  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I should have laid low. I-I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.98,0:39:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该过去  但我很高兴我能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have hung back. But I'm glad I was able --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.05,0:40:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找我们的先知吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we find our prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.77,0:40:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想陪你妈妈多久就陪多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take all the time you need with your mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.71,0:41:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"在地底的洞府中住着一个霍比特人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In a hole in the ground, there lived a Hobbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.68,0:41:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是那种让人恶心的洞  脏兮兮湿乎乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not a nasty, dirty, wet hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.12,0:41:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长满虫子  透着一股子泥腥味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"filled with the ends of worms and an oozy smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.80,0:41:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是那种满是沙子的洞  干巴巴光秃秃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"nor yet a dry, bare, sandy hole
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.15,0:41:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没地方好坐  也没东西好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}"with nothing in it to sit down on or to eat --
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.67,0:41:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个霍比特人的洞  \N{\fnArial\fs30}"It was a hobbit-hole, 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而霍比特人的洞就意味着舒适"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and that means comfort."
